                            displayMode="singleText"
                            elementNames="itinerary"
                            fragmentPath="/content/dam/weekender-shared/en/adventures/ski-touring-mont-blanc/ski-touring-mont-blanc"
                            paragraphScope="range"
                            text="Ski Touring Mont Blanc Day 1 Arrival at the chalet in the afternoon. The guide checks the equipment, and we practise with transceivers in the garden before dinner. Day 2 A warm-up tour above the valley: 700 metres of climbing, a lesson in kick turns and a descent through larch forest. Day 3 A cable car lifts us to the glacier. We rope up, cross it on skins and climb to a pass on the Italian border, then ski down to the hut for the night. Day 4 The big day. We leave the hut at first light for a summit of 3,500 metres, and ski 2,000 metres of descent back to the valley floor. Day 5 A short morning tour if the legs and the weather agree, lunch together and departure."
                            variationName="master">
